  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;此資源包仍在持續開發中，未來將在有更多 Blackout 材質可用時加入（例如：擴充模組支援）。</p>\n<p><strong>目前已支援的擴充模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2WLIB</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appliede\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppliedE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-network-analyser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Network Analyser</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-energistique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars &Eacute;nergistique</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Generators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bigger-ae2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bigger AE2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-experienced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Experienced</a><br><br>\n<p><strong>免責聲明</strong></p>\n<p>這些材質大多數並非我所製作，我是從&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energetics 2 (AE2)</a>&nbsp;以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ae2-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Dark Mode</a> 取得的。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如有需要請在 Discord 上聯絡我：void_odyssey</p>\n<p><strong>功能特色</strong></p>\n<p>將 AE2 及其擴充模組的大多數材質改為深色模式。<br>另外，新風格的深色材質也已回溯移植至 1.20.1。</p>\n<p>方塊變更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pVTtfsS.png\" alt=\"*方塊變更*\" width=\"1148\" height=\"914\"></p>\n<p>物品變更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tsRQwTh.png\" alt=\"*物品變更*\" width=\"1296\" height=\"729\"></p>",
